{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "2d5c2fdaecd72a3e8b719dc6d9e6f5e3d73b4253c06173e20000571259215a51", "ja": "ダンサブル・ガールズ", "zh": "跳舞少女", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1b4f07471039d3f69e891e37b83f0c9892530a101f07548222cdbd5aacdb7a17", "ja": "歩、のり子、海美、エレナで新ユニットが結\n成された。90年代風の新曲に盛り上がる一\n同は、数日後には完璧にダンスを仕上げてく\nる。だがリーダーの歩は違和感を抱いている\n様子。そこでプロデューサーは特訓を提案。", "zh": "步、法子、海美和艾蕾娜组成了新组合。90年代风格的新曲让\n众人兴奋不已，几天后便带着完美完成的舞蹈归来。\n但作为队长的步似乎感到有些不对劲。于是制作人提议\n进行特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "89bee7c80b64f1d366975e8081d4343ff8033b1c6a55410228ad936464486d41", "ja": "（みんなに新ユニットの説明だ！　早速、\n曲を聴いてもらっているが……反応はどうだろう）", "zh": "（要向大家介绍新组合了！刚开始让她们听这首歌……反应会怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e26acbac2c20a706e960c358a323fcea426889c7106fca537bb077c043c7141", "ja": "うわぁ～、なんかノリが良くていい感じだね！\n歩、こういうの好きなんじゃない？", "zh": "哇～，感觉节奏很带劲，真不错！\n阿步，你不是很喜欢这种风格吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "09ffaa4847eb75f1759c5bd4ec7450390d4680c2cec4c2726e13062308fb7533", "ja": "うん！　聴いてるだけで、どんなダンスにしようって\nアイディアが浮かんでくる……たまらないよ！", "zh": "嗯！光是听着，就会不断冒出“要编什么样的舞呢”的点子……真是让人欲罢不能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "8e276f3a21b80c3f5fdc6966c9bcf5cc9379dc6ed99e96ba4f1d21e26c58a1e6", "ja": "ワタシも、ノリがいい曲は大好きだヨ♪\nウミもそうでしょ？", "zh": "我也最喜欢这种带劲的歌了哟♪  \n海美也是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "8a09f7639e7f4febbd14299484962004eebe533a839ed00085f1cd211bc20d97", "ja": "わかる、わかるよえれなん！　こう、\n体の奥から、ぐわーって来る感じだよね！", "zh": "太懂了，我懂的哦艾蕾娜！就是那种，\n从身体深处“轰——”地涌上来的感觉对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "549d235ccc42a42f8356876afc498a6ea3ffd902287e762ca955aa908c89f587", "ja": "ぐわーって来るし、ぎゅんぎゅんって感じで、\n最高だよ！", "zh": "感觉一阵阵涌上来，还嗖嗖地加速，真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "c0741d097be5593bda68bb669513a7133223a2d023872687fbe39fda3336a9a1", "ja": "つまり、今回はぐわーって来て、ぎゅんぎゅんな\n曲ってコトだネ、{$P$}！", "zh": "也就是说，这次是首气势汹汹、让人心潮澎湃的歌，对吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7f41f5dc9f7a7b8a856ffd0374c34436349db9b942f5c8303808162150d83316", "ja": "そうだな！　とにかく、みんなが気に入った事だけは\n伝わってきたよ。ユニット結成、決まりだな！", "zh": "是啊！总之，大家都喜欢这一点，我已经感受到了。组建组合，就这么定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "529cb4570c1671d91846bde3d6e893529a4df6d2a05f591e86b4e07f3652e8ed", "ja": "もちろんだよ！\nNOなんて、言うわけないって。", "zh": "那当然啦！\n我怎么可能会说NO呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "84746bd20fe92bd7eb11ee75dba9337dcef55bc4007fe184bf4411af9b022ab2", "ja": "どんなダンスになるのか、楽しみだな～♪\nあっ、今から準備運動始めないとかな？", "zh": "会编成什么样的舞蹈呢，真让人期待啊～♪\n啊，对了，现在是不是得开始做热身运动了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "194fd5c02d9fc24897bdf8b84d669194a8deb5cbba864da5eb61ebdcc75e2c9c", "ja": "はは、気が早いな。それで、このユニットの\nリーダーなんだけど……歩がいいかと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，真是心急啊。不过，关于这个组合的队长……我觉得步挺合适的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ee64ce7ff643d18268dbf132184db66cc5dd6e3fbccd44945086663de68bd394", "ja": "ええっ！？　アタシがリーダー！？\nそ、そんなの初耳なんだけど！", "zh": "诶！？我当队长！？\n这我可还是第一次听说啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b2ef817ed99508b99baa735abd391b2e246ed401be30ab8e223e7dea9e5b57d0", "ja": "今初めて言ったからな！　メンバーの中では\n一番年上だし、ぴったりかなと思って。", "zh": "因为我也是现在才第一次说嘛！在成员里你年纪最大，我觉得挺合适的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "50a731309da489c5eeff96e5effe4e92ade39bf55ef2c2536bdcf178741ddcfe", "ja": "確かに、この中じゃ一番年上だけど……\nアタシにリーダーなんて、務まるのかな～？", "zh": "确实，在这里面我是年纪最大的，但是……\n让我来当队长，真的能胜任吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "c5c9529df1bfbf1ca08e0573be690d8cd87e38f2da72e7eec20dcbe3f055af0d", "ja": "じゃあ、年齢順で2番目のアタシが\nサブリーダーやったげる！　サポートするよ！", "zh": "那我这个按年龄排第2的，就来当副队长吧！我会支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "22375f2931db33132463142df37a17f780cda30c6907e5c25e14c85998d206ca", "ja": "それに新曲、気に入ったんでしょ？　だったら、\nリーダーやってみるのも悪くないと思うけどな。", "zh": "而且你也喜欢新歌吧？既然这样，我觉得试着当当队长也不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "ecc0c4920545f31340d8f9dae6b2877659fc4f8d8f93ca051f95063fa3f942e6", "ja": "アユムがリーダー、いいと思うナ！\nとびっきりクールでホットなダンスが見たいヨ～！", "zh": "让步当队长，我觉得挺好的呀！\n我想看超酷又超火热的舞蹈哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "26d9c46e74bd8b8d51d35cbe5549c965b488fe0d0f17b436345f129b4238ec63", "ja": "うんうん♪　歩がリーダーなら、ダンスで\nアドリブ入れても合わせてくれそうだし！", "zh": "嗯嗯♪　要是步当队长的话，就算在跳舞时\n即兴发挥，感觉也能配合得上呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "960190c96e4fa1192421e0406063be1ac2af1d5fc8f382ccb327c81907c539ff", "ja": "あ、アドリブの話とか、まだ早いって！　う～、\nリーダーとか、向いてる気はしないけど……。", "zh": "啊，还没到聊即兴发挥的时候啦！呜——我觉得自己不太适合当队长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "eacdd9335155845705d7f31891de4214cfcf84b4f158eb72c6d3cb9fce673a93", "ja": "でも、みんなこう言ってくれてるし……\nやれるとこまで、やってみるよ！", "zh": "不过，既然大家都这么说……\n那我就试试看，尽力做到自己能做到的程度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1020_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "aafabf447a42e874f52986f997dc5346e132b0f36ebc2b320c16616e8ed9e316", "ja": "よし！　歩、これでどう？　今度こそダンス、\nばっちり決まったんじゃない？", "zh": "好！步，这样怎么样？这次舞蹈\n跳得很完美了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "25e7c2e82588c3e755f45f47d6ab9483368682b804083db3bc64dd05e42060a8", "ja": "うん！　みんな、上手に踊れたと思うナ！", "zh": "嗯！我觉得大家这次都跳得很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "16d8e98e8d54d86ab21bfa2afa4719b75beae4bd2e097dddf7f12c0eb4b9f9df", "ja": "うーん……。\nいいんだけど、よくないというか……。", "zh": "嗯……该说是不错，可又觉得不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "790b7ccc643785a3460f6dc9004b9e85c498a2fac607f0c553251f98acd7ea80", "ja": "そうなの？　{$P$}から見て、\nダメなところ、ある？", "zh": "是这样吗？从{$P$}来看，有什么不太行的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "4dd830f962733fe65757238d22212585617340fba0e2ea2de9df1d3b6c56afa0", "ja": "いや、みんなさすがだよ。覚えも早いし、\nダンスパートはほぼ完璧……に、見えるんだけど……。", "zh": "不，大家都真不愧是你们。学得很快，\n舞蹈部分也几乎称得上完美……虽然看着是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8f8b501359bfe4b2d9fc3997585726d913a7bde56090d7c9060dd004f2c7553d", "ja": "うん。……アタシも、なんか違う気がしてる。\nでも、うまく言葉にできなくてさ……。", "zh": "嗯。……我也觉得好像哪里不对。\n可是，又不知道该怎么用语言表达出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "983aa93aa1fc701aa5a14039dcd196045c91263924a73a23fa58a405c89c3d38", "ja": "そっか～。\n言葉にできない感じだと、難しいネ……。", "zh": "这样啊～。\n如果是那种说不清楚的感觉，确实挺难的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7b3fc854878aabf942886b76cff1c8899065558c491e59ddccabed3349c5ec92", "ja": "あっ……ごめん！　がんばってるのに、\nネガティブなこと言っちゃって。", "zh": "啊……对不起！明明你在努力，我却说了些消极的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "624cca95334010a580fee7711cce713ae60b93feebe4a5ffe597172eb57053e1", "ja": "ううん。歩だけじゃなくて、{$P$}も\nなんでしょ？　気になるところがあるの。", "zh": "不会。不仅是步，{$P$}也是\n这样吧？有什么在意的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "ab0e284c1f535e5083bb10960fb8ad58539966ceeb38584d39c3f6f12fff5fca", "ja": "だったら、なんとかしなくっちゃ。\nね、みんな！", "zh": "既然这样，就得想办法解决才行。\n对吧，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "ae6d2fe3722c987fcc07518ef20884a76a5c4b94a04a1bcdcb770c03363d4ca3", "ja": "そうだヨ！　ワタシたち全員が、\n気持ちよく踊れなくちゃネ！", "zh": "没错哟！我们所有人都得跳得开心才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "d707aeef79ba01d6cd04f881cdecdf695b2c3fe2f5410319db23cfc95b0dc56f", "ja": "うん。だから大丈夫だよ、歩！\n気になることがあったら、どんどん言って！", "zh": "嗯。所以没关系，步！\n如果有什么在意的地方，就尽管说出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ee53acf3a84e105d9feeaf20d4fbe88cf5af38e01abf615e417b54358f105f08", "ja": "みんな……うう、ありがとう。\n情けないリーダーでごめん……。", "zh": "大家……呜呜，谢谢你们。\n对不起，我是个没用的队长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "e27bd686ff80559ee75dd1c45237ec1d0a4b6841bbf66895f97cd3ddf47736ef", "ja": "気にしないの、歩。\nアタシたち、ユニットなんだからさ！", "zh": "别在意，小步。\n我们可是一个组合啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0135_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_01_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "986efa6b35bddb75c52d66bbd041ebb9877c21e83958d047fc3831bd01755a4d", "ja": "うん。……アタシも、ちゃんと考えてみる。\nこのユニットを、理想の形に近づけないとだよ！", "zh": "嗯……我也会好好想想的。\n得让这个组合更接近理想的形态才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
